{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities using only the allowed events. The specification enforces safe exploration with a strong bias toward forward progress, always turning right (rotate_clockwise) for recovery, and never enabling move_forward when an obstacle is detected. Recovery states only allow rotate_clockwise and return to forward progress as soon as path_clear is observed. All uncontrollable events are handled in every state, and the automata are deterministic.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model robot's motion and perception as a single plant automaton with all allowed events.",
    "Specification automaton enforces always-turn-right recovery, disables move_forward on any obstacle, and returns to forward progress immediately after path_clear."
